Bugs found in Palantir internal testing:

  * Wrong tree sort order (fixed before ef2b369387 ("merge-ort: add
    implementation of record_conflicted_index_entries()", 2020-12-13)
    was submitted)
  * Stable sort algorithm relied upon for proper handling of rename/rename
    conflicts (see 3ca16a5e34 ("merge-ort: use STABLE_QSORT instead of
    QSORT where required", 2021-03-04))
  * Crash on conflicted file that is SKIP_WORKTREE in index but present
    anyway; note that merge-recursive (still) silently overwrites user
    modifications, while merge-ort previously crashed (fixed before
    90a57ade62 ("merge-ort: implement CE_SKIP_WORKTREE handling with
    conflicted entries", 2021-03-02) was submitted)

